
title: Elenda
---
<<declare $metElenda = false>>
<<declare $elendaScrollQuestStarted = false>>
<<declare $elendaScrollInfoFound = false>>
<<declare $elendaScrollQuestComplete = false>>
<<declare $elendaPotionGiven = false>>
<<declare $elendaPositiveInteractionUnlocked = false>>
<<declare $elendaPositiveInteractionSeen = false>>
<<if $metElenda == false>>
    Elenda: Hmph...
    Elenda: Fragments of ancient magic, scattered across a broken landscape.
    Elenda: Yet none of it behaves as it should.
    {$playerName}: Are you talking to yourself?
    Elenda: ...
    Elenda: Apparently, I was.
    Elenda: Do you make a habit of interrupting people while they are working?
    -> Sorry, I didn't mean to interrupt
        <<change_affection GameManager "characterelenda" 5>>
        {$playerName}: Sorry. I didn't realise you were busy.
        Elenda: At least you possess some manners.
        Elenda: An increasingly rare quality.
    -> I was just curious
        {$playerName}: I was curious about what you were studying.
        Elenda: Curiosity is a dangerous quality.
        Elenda: Although I suppose it is preferable to ignorance.
    -> You don't have to be so rude
        {$playerName}: You don't have to be so rude.
        Elenda: And you don't have to disturb my research.
        Elenda: Yet here we are.
    Elenda: ...
    Elenda: Since you insist on remaining, perhaps you can make yourself useful.
    {$playerName}: Useful?
    Elenda: My name is Elenda.
    Elenda: Though I suspect you may have heard another name.
    {$playerName}: Which is?
    Elenda: The Ashen Witch.
    {$playerName}: You're a witch?
    Elenda: An observant one, aren't you?
    Elenda: I am a researcher of magic, curses, and matters most people are frightened by.
    {$playerName}: And what are you researching here?
    Elenda: That is precisely what I am attempting to determine.
    Elenda: These islands are saturated with an unusual magical residue.
    Elenda: Something powerful occurred here.
    Elenda: Something that has distorted the natural order.
    {$playerName}: Do you know what caused it?
    Elenda: Not yet.
    Elenda: However, I have heard an interesting rumour.
    Elenda: Apparently, someone wandering these islands possesses an old scroll.
    Elenda: One containing knowledge that may have been deliberately concealed.
    {$playerName}: What kind of knowledge?
    Elenda: If I knew that, I would hardly need the scroll.
    Elenda: It may contain information about the islands.
    Elenda: Or perhaps the curse that seems to linger over this place.
    Elenda: Either way, I intend to examine it.
    {$playerName}: Why don't you look for it yourself?
    Elenda: Because I have more pressing matters to attend to.
    Elenda: And because...
    Elenda: ...
    {$playerName}: Because?
    Elenda: Nothing of consequence.
    Elenda: Find whoever possesses the scroll.
    Elenda: Discover what they know and report back to me.
    -> I'll investigate the scroll
        {$playerName}: Alright. I'll see what I can find.
        Elenda: Good.
        Elenda: Perhaps you will prove more useful than I initially expected.
        <<set $elendaScrollQuestStarted = true>>
        <<start_quest QuestManager "elenda_scroll">>
    -> Why should I help you?
        {$playerName}: What do I get out of helping you?
        Elenda: Knowledge.
        Elenda: And perhaps the opportunity to learn something that may save your life.
        Elenda: I assure you, that is more valuable than a handful of coins.
        {$playerName}: Fine. I'll investigate.
        <<set $elendaScrollQuestStarted = true>>
        <<start_quest QuestManager "elenda_scroll">>
    -> I have other things to do
        {$playerName}: I'm busy with something else right now.
        Elenda: Then stop wasting my time.
        Elenda: Return when you are prepared to be useful.
    <<set $metElenda = true>>
<<else>>
    <<jump ElendaReturn>>
<<endif>>
===
title: ElendaReturn
---
<<if $elendaScrollQuestComplete == true>>
    <<jump ElendaRelationship>>
<<elseif $elendaScrollQuestStarted == false>>
    Elenda: You again.
    Elenda: Have you reconsidered my proposal?
    -> I'll investigate the scroll
        {$playerName}: I'll find out who has that scroll.
        Elenda: Good.
        Elenda: Report back when you have something worth telling me.
        <<set $elendaScrollQuestStarted = true>>
        <<start_quest QuestManager "elenda_scroll">>
    -> Not yet
        {$playerName}: Not right now.
        Elenda: Then I suggest you leave me to my research.
<<elseif has_item("ancient_scroll")>>
    Elenda: You're back.
    Elenda: And judging by your expression, you have discovered something.
    {$playerName}: I found the scroll you were looking for.
    Elenda: You actually found it?
    Elenda: Let me see.
    -> Give Elenda the Scroll
        {$playerName}: Here. I thought you might be interested in this.
        Elenda: Interesting...
        Elenda: These markings are much older than I anticipated.
        Elenda: This may contain information about the magic affecting these islands.
        <<remove_item GameManager "ancient_scroll">>
        <<set $elendaScrollInfoFound = true>>
        <<set $elendaScrollQuestComplete = true>>
        <<complete_quest QuestManager "elenda_scroll">>
        <<change_affection GameManager "characterelenda" 10>>
        Elenda: You have done well.
        Elenda: Better than I anticipated.
        {$playerName}: Was that a compliment?
        Elenda: Do not become accustomed to it.
        Elenda: Nevertheless, you have my thanks.
        <<jump ElendaPotionConversation>>
    -> Keep the Scroll
        {$playerName}: I'd like to examine it a little longer.
        Elenda: Hmph.
        Elenda: Very well. But do not keep me waiting indefinitely.
    <<jump ElendaPotionConversation>>
<<else>>
    Elenda: Have you discovered anything about the scroll?
    -> Not yet
        {$playerName}: I'm still looking.
        Elenda: Then I suggest you continue looking.
    -> Ask about the strange magic
        {$playerName}: What have you discovered about this place?
        Elenda: The magical residue here is unlike anything I have studied.
        Elenda: And believe me, I have studied a great deal.
        Elenda: Something has disrupted the boundaries between places that should never have touched.
        {$playerName}: Is that why the islands are floating?
        Elenda: Perhaps.
        Elenda: But I will not offer conclusions without evidence.
        <<jump ElendaReturn>>
    -> Ask if she's alright
        <<jump ElendaPotionConversation>>
<<endif>>
===
title: ElendaPotionConversation
---
<<if $elendaPotionGiven == true>>
    Elenda: My injuries are no longer a concern.
    Elenda: You needn't ask again.
    <<jump ElendaRelationship>>
<<else>>
    {$playerName}: Are you alright?
    Elenda: Perfectly.
    {$playerName}: You don't look perfectly alright.
    Elenda: Your concern is unnecessary.
    {$playerName}: You're holding your arm.
    Elenda: ...
    Elenda: An unfortunate consequence of investigating an unstable magical formation.
    Elenda: I miscalculated the strength of a defensive enchantment.
    Elenda: The resulting discharge was... unpleasant.
    {$playerName}: So you got hurt?
    Elenda: A minor injury.
    Elenda: Hardly worth discussing.
    Elenda: Although...
    Elenda: A restorative concoction would accelerate the healing process.
    {$playerName}: You mean a Health Potion?
    Elenda: Naturally.
    Elenda: Unfortunately, my supplies were lost when I arrived here.
    Elenda: But I am perfectly capable of managing without one.
    <<if has_item("health_potion")>>
        -> Give Elenda a Health Potion
            {$playerName}: Here. You can have mine.
            Elenda: ...
            Elenda: You would give me a potion without asking for anything in return?
            {$playerName}: You need it more than I do.
            Elenda: How peculiar.
            <<remove_item GameManager "health_potion">>
            <<set $elendaPotionGiven = true>>
            <<change_affection GameManager "characterelenda" 20>>
            Elenda: Very well.
            Elenda: I accept.
            Elenda: ...
            Elenda: Thank you.
            {$playerName}: You're welcome.
            Elenda: Do not misunderstand.
            Elenda: This does not mean I suddenly require your assistance with everything.
            {$playerName}: Of course not.
            Elenda: ...
            Elenda: Still, your kindness will not be forgotten.
    <<else>>
        -> I'll find you a Health Potion
            {$playerName}: I'll see if I can find something to help.
            Elenda: I did not ask you to do that.
            {$playerName}: I know.
            Elenda: ...
            Elenda: Do as you wish.
    <<endif>>
        -> Leave her to rest
            {$playerName}: I'll let you get back to your research.
            Elenda: Sensible.
<<endif>>
<<if $elendaScrollQuestComplete == true && $elendaPotionGiven == true>>
    <<set $elendaPositiveInteractionUnlocked = true>>
    Elenda: Before you go...
    Elenda: There is something I would like to discuss with you.
    Elenda: When you have the time.
<<endif>>
===
title: ElendaRelationship
---
<<if $elendaPositiveInteractionSeen == true>>
    Elenda: Ah. You've returned.
    Elenda: I was reviewing my research notes.
    Elenda: I suppose a short interruption would not be entirely unwelcome.
<<elseif $elendaPositiveInteractionUnlocked == true>>
    Elenda: There you are.
    Elenda: I was beginning to wonder whether you intended to return.
    {$playerName}: Were you waiting for me?
    Elenda: Do not be absurd.
    Elenda: I merely wished to discuss something.
<<else>>
    Elenda: You've returned.
    Elenda: Have you something useful to discuss?
<<endif>>
-> Ask about her research
    {$playerName}: How long have you been studying magic?
    Elenda: Longer than you might imagine.
    Elenda: Centuries of observation, experimentation, and disappointment.
    {$playerName}: Centuries?
    Elenda: Yes.
    Elenda: Magic has a tendency to preserve those who understand it.
    Elenda: Whether that preservation is a blessing is another matter.
    <<jump ElendaRelationship>>
-> Ask about the curse
    {$playerName}: Do you know anything about curses?
    Elenda: More than most.
    Elenda: Curses are rarely as simple as the stories suggest.
    Elenda: Some can be broken.
    Elenda: Others merely change form.
    {$playerName}: Could you help someone suffering from one?
    Elenda: Possibly.
    Elenda: But I would need to examine the curse before making promises.
    Elenda: Bring me evidence, and perhaps we can discuss it further.
    <<jump ElendaRelationship>>
<<if $elendaPotionGiven == false>>
-> Ask about her injury 
    <<jump ElendaPotionConversation>>
<<endif>>
<<if $elendaPositiveInteractionUnlocked == true>>
-> Speak with Elenda privately
    <<jump ElendaPositiveInteraction>>
<<endif>>
-> Leave
    {$playerName}: I'll leave you to your work.
    Elenda: Very well.
    Elenda: Try not to get yourself killed.
===
title: ElendaPositiveInteraction
---
Elenda: Close the door.
Elenda: Or at least ensure no one is listening.
{$playerName}: Is something wrong?
Elenda: No.
Elenda: I simply prefer conversations without unnecessary witnesses.
Elenda: I have spent centuries studying magic.
Elenda: I have witnessed kingdoms rise, flourish, and disappear.
Elenda: And through it all, I have remained.
{$playerName}: That sounds lonely.
Elenda: Loneliness is an indulgence I cannot afford.
Elenda: Research requires discipline.
Elenda: Attachments complicate matters.
{$playerName}: But you still wanted to talk to me.
Elenda: ...
Elenda: You helped me locate information that may be valuable.
Elenda: And you offered assistance when you had nothing to gain.
Elenda: I find that... difficult to understand.
{$playerName}: Why?
Elenda: Because most people seek something from me.
Elenda: Power. Knowledge. Protection.
Elenda: Rarely do they concern themselves with the person behind the title.
Elenda: Tell me something.
Elenda: Why did you help me?
-> Because you deserved kindness
    {$playerName}: Because you deserved kindness, just like anyone else.
    Elenda: ...
    Elenda: An unusual answer.
    Elenda: Yet I find myself hoping you mean it.
    <<if $elendaPositiveInteractionSeen == false>>
        <<change_affection GameManager "characterelenda" 10>>
    <<endif>>
-> Because I want to understand you
    {$playerName}: Because I want to understand you, not just the Ashen Witch.
    Elenda: Understand me?
    Elenda: A rather ambitious undertaking.
    Elenda: ...
    Elenda: But perhaps not an unwelcome one.
    <<if $elendaPositiveInteractionSeen == false>>
        <<change_affection GameManager "characterelenda" 10>>
    <<endif>>
-> Because your knowledge could help me
    {$playerName}: Because your knowledge might help me find a way out.
    Elenda: At least you are honest.
    Elenda: I can respect that.
<<set $elendaPositiveInteractionSeen = true>>
Elenda: There is something else.
{$playerName}: What is it?
Elenda: If you intend to continue exploring these islands, you will need more than a sword and blind determination.
Elenda: I may be willing to teach you a few things.
{$playerName}: You'd teach me magic?
Elenda: Perhaps.
Elenda: If you demonstrate the patience and discipline required.
Elenda: Consider it an offer.
Elenda: One I do not extend lightly.
{$playerName}: I'll keep that in mind.
Elenda: Good.
Elenda: And {$playerName}...
{$playerName}: Yes?
Elenda: Thank you.
Elenda: For treating me as something more than a title.
===
